# Empty

Shows an empty state, such as a list with no items or a search with no results. Compose it from `Empty`, `EmptyHeader`, `EmptyMedia`, `EmptyTitle`, `EmptyDescription`, and `EmptyContent`.

<Demo />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<script lang="ts">
	import { Empty, EmptyHeader, EmptyMedia, EmptyTitle, EmptyDescription, EmptyContent } from "#lib/components/ui/empty/index.js";
	import { Button } from "#lib/components/ui/button/index.js";
	import { FolderCodeIcon } from "@lucide/svelte";
</script>

<Empty>
	<EmptyHeader>
		<EmptyMedia variant="icon"><FolderCodeIcon /></EmptyMedia>
		<EmptyTitle>No projects yet</EmptyTitle>
		<EmptyDescription>Get started by creating your first project.</EmptyDescription>
	</EmptyHeader>
	<EmptyContent>
		<Button>Create project</Button>
	</EmptyContent>
</Empty>
```

## Installation

```pm
npx remote0 add https://plainsv.com/r/empty.json
```

## Anatomy

`Empty` centers its parts in a column and fills the room of its container. `EmptyHeader` holds the media, the `h3` title, and the muted description in a readable width. `EmptyMedia` shows an image or avatar as is, or puts an icon on a muted square with `variant="icon"`. `EmptyContent` holds actions, such as buttons or a search input. Links in the description are underlined.

## Outline

Set `variant="outline"` to draw a dashed border, such as around an upload area.

<Demo section="outline" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<Empty variant="outline">...</Empty>
```

## Sizes

Set `size` to `xs`, `sm`, `md`, or `lg`. The default is `lg`, like the shadcn empty state, and the padding, gaps, text size, and corner radius follow the size.

<Demo section="sizes" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<Empty variant="outline" size="sm">...</Empty>
```

## Rounded

Set `rounded` to `xs` through `4xl` or `pill` to override the radius of the outline that follows `size`. `pill` is a true pill and can clip tall content, so use `3xl` or `4xl` for round corners that stay safe.

<Demo section="rounded" />

```svelte title="+page.svelte"
<Empty variant="outline" rounded="sm">...</Empty>
```

## API

`Empty`, `EmptyMedia`, and `EmptyContent` extend the native `div` attributes. `EmptyHeader`, `EmptyTitle`, and `EmptyDescription` extend the `header`, `h3`, and `p` attributes.

```ts title="index.ts"
interface Props extends CompPropsWithChild<"div"> {
	/** `default` has no border; `outline` draws a dashed border */
	variant?: "default" | "outline";
	/** Padding, gap, and text size on the shared scale; defaults to `lg` */
	size?: UiSize;
	/** Corner radius of the outline; follows `size` when omitted. `pill` is a true pill that can clip the content, so use `3xl` or `4xl` to stay round */
	rounded?: UiRounded;
}

interface MediaProps extends CompPropsWithChild<"div"> {
	/** `default` shows the media as is; `icon` puts an icon on a muted square */
	variant?: "default" | "icon";
}
```
